flowchart TD
    A[Kafka Topic Partition] -->|Consume Batch of 5000 Events| B(In-Memory Aggregator)
    
    B --> C{Parse Event Type}
    
    C -->|TASK_CREATED| D[Delta Map: Project A + 1]
    C -->|TASK_DELETED| E[Delta Map: Project A - 1]
    C -->|TASK_COMPLETED| F[Delta Map: Project A Completed + 1]
    
    D --> G(Semantic Fold)
    E --> G
    F --> G
    
    G -->|Net Result: Project A (+0 Tasks, +1 Completed)| H[(PostgreSQL)]
    H -->|Single UPDATE Query| I[project table]
